  "name": "Question 9",
  "problem": "If $\\overset{\\to }{m}=⟨-6,2⟩$ and $\\overset{\\to }{n}=⟨5,-8⟩$, then $\\overset{\\to }{m}-\\overset{\\to }{n}=$$\\,⟨$\n{{field-1}}$\\,,$\n{{field-2}}$⟩.$",
  "worked_solution": "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{m}-\\overset{\\to }{n} & =⟨-6,2⟩-⟨5,-8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-6-5,\\,2-(-8)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-11,10⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$",
